Here is a complete HTML file that builds a pixel-perfect Space Invaders arcade game, recreating the original 1978 Taito cabinet experience.
```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Space Invaders - 1978 Taito Arcade</title>
  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
    body {
      background: #000;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      min-height: 100vh;
      font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
    }
    .cabinet-wrapper {
      background: #111;
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 20px 30px;
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px #333, 0 0 20px #0000aa;
      border: 2px solid #444;
    }
    .game-container {
      position: relative;
      background: #000;
      width: 800px;
      height: 600px;
      border: 4px solid #222;
      box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 2px #0a0a0a, 0 0 0 2px #000;
    }
    canvas {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      image-rendering: pixelated;
      background: #000;
    }
    .info-panel {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      color: #ff0;
      font-size: 18px;
      padding: 8px 12px;
      background: #000;
      border-bottom: 2px solid #333;
      text-shadow: 0 0 4px #0f0;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
    }
    .score, .lives, .high {
      background: #000;
      padding: 2px 8px;
      border: 1px solid #0f0;
    }
    .controls {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      color: #0f0;
      font-size: 12px;
      padding: 6px 0;
      background: #111;
      border-top: 2px solid #333;
      gap: 20px;
    }
    .controls span {
      background: #000;
      padding: 0 6px;
      border: 1px solid #555;
    }
    /* pixel art style */
    .game-overlay {
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
